# Cloudflare Pages headers (Phase 2.6). GitHub Pages ignores this file, so it
# ships harmlessly during the dual-deploy migration window.
#
# Deliberately NO X-Frame-Options / frame-ancestors here: the embed and the
# widgets exist to be iframed by operator sites. Per-tenant frame-ancestors
# arrives as a Pages Function in Phase 4.4.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains; preload
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
